{
  "milestone": "M109-smoke",
  "title": "M109 instrument smoke test — INADMISSIBLE AS EVIDENCE",
  "registered_in": "analysis/RESEARCH_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN_v16.md section 5.2",
  "_smoke_note": "NOT A RESULT AND NEVER QUOTABLE AS ONE. Eight rows per class, one resolution (28), one epoch per rung, 2048 atoms (see sparse._smoke_note for the MAC arithmetic that keeps the gate decidable). Its only job is to prove the code paths execute: parity guard, corpus, whitener/dictionary, t1 frozen ridge, t2 linear, t3 LoRA/dictionary-grad, t4 full fine-tune/from-scratch, and the gate evaluates. Every accuracy it produces is meaningless.",
  "_smoke_skip_reproduction_gate": true,
  "corpus": {
